{"id": "DfJVLZ-xwtq", "title": "Video by astro_zova", "description": "बिना लड़े… पूरा महाभारत जीत लिया 🏹\n\n3 बाण, जो किसी भी युद्ध को एक पल में ख़त्म कर सकते थे।\n1 वचन, \"हारने वाले का साथ दूँगा।\"\nऔर 1 दान, जो कृष्ण ने माँगा… उसका शीश। 🙏\n\nआज वही बर्बरीक पूजे जाते हैं… खाटू श्याम के नाम से।\nहारे का सहारा, बाबा श्याम हमारा ❤️\n\n💬 कमेंट में लिखिए \"जय श्री श्याम\"\n📌 Save करें, किसी श्याम भक्त को भेजें\n\n🔮 अपनी दैनिक कुंडली देखें: zovaastro.in\n\n#khatushyam #barbarik #jaishreeshyam #haarekasahara #mahabharat #krishna #shyambaba #hindumythology #sanatandharma #mythologystories #khatushyamji #reelsindia #bhaktireels", "channel": "astro_zova", "uploader_id": "29969741716", "uploader": "Zova Astro", "timestamp": 1793422009, "like_count": 1293, "comment_count": 3, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-28904023592592778a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 76.916, "asr": 96000, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fblr2-2.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQOJSZnb1fcFg5E8KKlsffpM06q8ZyLa8u45OvH_wcg3TUmvI0EqBX5aQyMx31wO_UCjKMNVlOCj3ziZQ8wrB5OScvua0kY5mvPRnQM.mp4?_nc_cat=109&_nc_oc=AdqRn10R-ASFXuHuBKVSZC5eswAmcDFbQbBZ0zl8iz9OuaT6k1in2MPBuomaOhtjxw9F8JoytAdU_fvirUCYj8J4&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.fblr2-2.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=gg7FSdUlUzkQ7kNvwG_Z4-x&%3D%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=-zr-wx-hLLnYNmQVgINosg&_nc_ss=70689&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQQkLXbSKJw5XiaoEc1Ub8sMADwekChDX3lxZ3GT9c7-FA&oe=6AF43D06", "manifest_stream_number": 0, "is_dash_periods": true, "protocol": "https", "audio_ext": "m4a", "video_ext": "none", "vbr": 0, "abr": 76.916, "resolution": "audio only", "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/150.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": "en-us,en;q=0.5", "Sec-Fetch-Mode"